@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed — Event status and attendee response dimensions
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "Provider event status observation" as E {
 state "Tentative (if observed)" as T
 state "Confirmed (if observed)" as C
 state "Cancelled (if observed)" as X
 T --> C : actual authorized / provider change evidence
 T --> X : actual cancellation evidence
 C --> T : actual status revision if supported
 C --> X : actual cancellation evidence
}
state "Attendee response observation" as A {
 state "Needs response" as N
 state "Accepted" as Y
 state "Declined" as D
 state "Tentative response" as M
 N --> Y : observed attendee response
 N --> D : observed attendee response
 N --> M : observed attendee response
 Y --> D : observed changed response
 M --> Y : observed changed response
}
note bottom of E
 Selected conceptual observation vocabulary, not complete provider enums.
 Local unlink is not provider cancellation; unknown deletion stays unknown.
 Attendee acceptance does not independently confirm an event or application.
end note

@enduml
